      "kind": "input",
      "description": "Native поле повторяет общие поверхность, границу и фокус.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\">ФИО участника<input class=\"ds-input\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"Имя участника\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{font-family:var(--font-sans);display:grid;gap:8px;color:var(--foreground);font-size:14px;font-weight:500}.ds-input{font-family:var(--font-sans);min-width:0;min-height:44px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--input);border-radius:10px;background:var(--card);color:var(--foreground);font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;caret-color:var(--primary)}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-input:disabled{opacity:.65}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-field,.ds-input{font-size:16px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-field{transition:none;scroll-behavior:auto}.ds-input{transition:none;scroll-behavior:auto}}",
      "refersTo": "field"
    },
    {
      "name": "Активная навигация",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Белая подпись и SVG на красной активной поверхности; доступны hover и клавиатурный фокус.",
      "html": "<nav aria-label=\"Разделы\"><a class=\"ds-nav\" href=\"#participants\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg><span>Участники</span></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:var(--font-sans);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:44px;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--sidebar-foreground);font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none}.ds-nav:hover{background:var(--muted)}.ds-nav[aria-current]{background:var(--sidebar-accent);color:var(--sidebar-accent-foreground);font-weight:500}.ds-nav:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav{transition:none;scroll-behavior:auto}}",
