      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Единая группа даты и стрелок; настольные области 32px, мобильные 44px.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-date-group\"><button class=\"ds-date-step\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Предыдущий день\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><button class=\"ds-date-value\" type=\"button\">18 октября 2026 г.</button><button class=\"ds-date-step\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Следующий день\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-date-group{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0;padding:2px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--card)}.ds-date-group button{font-family:var(--font-sans);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:32px;height:32px;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;color:var(--foreground);cursor:pointer}.ds-date-step{width:32px;min-width:32px;padding:0}.ds-date-value{padding:0 10px;font-size:13px}.ds-date-group button:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--muted)}.ds-date-group button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-date-group button:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-date-group button{height:44px;min-height:44px}.ds-date-step{width:44px;min-width:44px}.ds-date-value{font-size:16px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-date-group{transition:none;scroll-behavior:auto}.ds-date-step{transition:none;scroll-behavior:auto}.ds-date-value{transition:none;scroll-behavior:auto}}"
